    <activity>
        <statement>
            <p>
                <term>Work in your Groups</term>
            </p>
            <p>
                Your school is hosting sports day event. The sports committee needs to arrange chairs for spectators in a stepped layout so everyone can have a clear view of what's hapenning in the field.
            </p>
            <p>
                <ol marker="(a)">
                    <li>
                        <p>
                           The first row has <m>20</m> chairs. Each row behind it has <m>5</m> more chairs than the row infront. 
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            <ol marker="(i)">
                                <li>
                                    <p>
                                        Write the sequence for the number of chairs in the first <m>6</m> rows?
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <p>
                                        How many chairs are in row <m>10</m>?
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <p>
                                        If there are <m>15</m> rows, what is the total number of chairs needed?
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p>
                            The sports committee also plans a terchers section where the number of chairs in every row double in size. If the first row has <m>8</m> chairs.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            <ol marker="(i)">
                                <li>
                                    <p>
                                       Write the sequence for the first five rows? 
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <p>
                                        How many chairs are in row <m>8</m>?
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <p>
                                        If the budget allows for <m>7</m> rows, what is the total cost if each chair costs Ksh <m>3</m>?
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p>
                            If the field can fit a maximum of <m>300</m> chairs, which layout lets you fit more rows?
                        </p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p>
                            Which layout should the sports committee choose and why?
                        </p>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </p>
        </statement>
    </activity>
